FORM K-1.
IN THE MATTER OF: defined-terms.

OFF THE RECORD: every proper legal document begins by renaming
OFF THE RECORD: everyone involved, so that the rest of the document
OFF THE RECORD: may be conducted entirely in aliases.

HEREINAFTER, the-accused SHALL MEAN "Josef K.".
HEREINAFTER, the-tribunal SHALL MEAN "the Court of Inquiry".
HEREINAFTER, the-objection SHALL MEAN SUSTAINED.
HEREINAFTER, the-fine SHALL MEAN 500.

ARTICLE 1.
    PROCLAIM the-accused PLUS " v. " PLUS the-tribunal.
    PROCLAIM "Fine assessed: " PLUS THE TRANSCRIPT OF the-fine PLUS " marks.".
    SHOULD the-objection EQUAL SUSTAINED,
        PROCLAIM "The objection of " PLUS the-accused
            PLUS " is noted, sustained, and disregarded. The fine stands.".
    ADJOURN INDEFINITELY.
